# Next.js UI

- Renderer UI is Next.js + TypeScript + Tailwind + shadcn/ui. Do not add a second component library.
- This UI runs inside Electron. There is no Icerde mobile UI.
- Talk to the platform via GraphQL only.
- Real copy in Turkish (primary UI) with English where the user-facing product needs both.
- Every screen: empty, loading, error.
- Desktop and a usable narrow window (Electron may be resized). No mobile-app navigation patterns as the product shell.
- Do not call LLMs from the browser. Go through the API so GDPR and routing apply.
- Theme from [docs/design/tokens.css](docs/design/tokens.css). Do not ship default shadcn violet.
- Read [docs/frontend.md](docs/frontend.md), [docs/design-system.md](docs/design-system.md), [docs/screens.md](docs/screens.md), [docs/motion.md](docs/motion.md) before adding routes.
